        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "to-fight-a-god:noczo",
          "html": "Once inside, enter <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Zamorakian_Undercity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">the Zamorakian Undercity</a> by using the nearby <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Zamorakian_Undercity_(scenery)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pulley lift</a> (a few steps east of the larger-looking <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pulley_(City_of_Senntisten)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pulley</a> used to enter and exit Senntisten).",
          "text": "Once inside, enter the Zamorakian Undercity by using the nearby pulley lift (a few steps east of the larger-looking pulley used to enter and exit Senntisten).",
